WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.666 line:71%
The Department of Justice

00:00:02.666 --> 00:00:04.000 size:88% position:44% line:71%
has a very serious

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.666 line:71%
and sensitive new investigation

00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:06.416 size:81% position:41% line:71%
on its hands.

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:07.625 size:78% position:39% line:71%
The DOJ now

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:10.083 position:59% line:71%
looking into leaks of classified U.S.

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:11.125 size:88% position:44% line:71%
military documents

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.625 position:56% line:71%
that were shared on social media.

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:13.958 position:56% line:71%
Some of the materials were marked

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:14.666 size:78% position:39% line:71%
top secret.

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:15.541 line:71%
That's the highest level

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:16.833 size:88% position:44% line:71%
of classification.

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:17.666 line:71%
The leaked documents

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:19.500 line:71%
covered everything from U.S.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.583 position:59% line:71%
support for Ukraine to key information

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:22.625 size:75% position:38% line:71%
about U.S.

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:23.208 size:72% position:36% line:71%
allies.

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:25.208 line:71%
CNN's Kylie Atwood joins us now.

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:26.708 position:56% line:71%
Kylie, what more are we learning?

00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:28.541 line:71%
It sounds as though

00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:31.833 position:58% line:71%
these documents are very sensitive.

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:32.291 size:69% position:34% line:71%
Yeah.

00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:33.541 line:71%
I mean, as you said,

00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:35.666 position:56% line:71%
some of these documents are marked

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:36.875 size:78% position:39% line:71%
top secret.

00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:38.041 line:71%
That's the highest level

00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:39.541 size:88% position:44% line:71%
of classification

00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:41.833 line:71%
in the US intelligence system.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.583 line:71%
And so obviously it's

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:45.333 position:56% line:71%
really concerning to US officials

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:46.000 size:78% position:39% line:71%
who are now

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.083 line:71%
trying to go through these

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:49.125 line:71%
documents, understand

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.333 line:71%
what exactly is in them.

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:52.791 position:61% line:71%
We still don't know the source of them.

00:00:52.791 --> 00:00:54.833 line:71%
So these documents appeared on

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:56.000 size:88% position:44% line:71%
social media sites

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.041 position:59% line:71%
over the course of the last few weeks,

00:00:58.041 --> 00:00:59.916 position:63% line:71%
and they gained some attention this week.

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:00.791 line:71%
The first documents

00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:01.500 line:71%
that gained attention

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.125 line:71%
had to do with us support

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.625 position:56% line:71%
for the for Ukraine, Ukraine war,

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:06.625 size:75% position:38% line:71%
war plans.

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:07.958 size:78% position:39% line:71%
And so U.S.

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:08.916 line:71%
officials were asked

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.291 line:71%
about those documents

00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:12.250 position:56% line:71%
and they said that they do appear

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.041 line:71%
to be legitimate U.S. documents.

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:15.125 line:71%
The other documents

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:16.416 line:71%
that we have just gone

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:18.041 line:71%
through in the last 24 hours

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:21.041 position:61% line:71%
or so that have to do with a widespread

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:22.166 size:84% position:42% line:71%
number of issues

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.708 line:71%
related to China, really

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:24.708 size:75% position:38% line:71%
related to

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:25.916 size:84% position:42% line:71%
Israel, related

00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:27.500 line:71%
to the United Arab Emirates.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.791 line:71%
Those are the documents

00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:30.125 line:71%
that the Pentagon says

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:31.583 line:71%
that they are still reviewing

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:32.833 size:81% position:41% line:71%
at this time.

00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:34.166 line:71%
And so we don't know

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:36.125 position:59% line:71%
if those are all legitimate documents.

00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:37.750 position:56% line:71%
But when you talk to US officials

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.625 position:59% line:71%
they say that they look like they are.

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:41.083 line:71%
So this is an incredibly

00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:42.416 size:88% position:44% line:71%
alarming situation

00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:44.083 line:71%
that's still unfolding in terms

00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:46.041 position:56% line:71%
of what kind of damage assessment

00:01:46.041 --> 00:01:47.583 line:71%
the US government will make.

00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:48.916 line:71%
As a result of this leak.

00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:50.750 size:88% position:44% line:71%
And what are U.S.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:51.291 size:75% position:38% line:71%
officials

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:54.166 line:71%
telling us about these documents

00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:56.666 line:71%
where they might have come from?

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:58.625 position:61% line:71%
I suppose there's plenty of speculation.

00:01:58.625 --> 00:02:00.291 line:71%
Do they have any best guesses

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:00.916 size:81% position:41% line:71%
at this point

00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:01.291 size:72% position:36% line:71%
or is it

00:02:01.291 --> 00:02:02.875 line:71%
still just too early on

00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:04.916 line:71%
in this investigation?

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.791 line:71%
Well, it is really early on,

00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:08.583 line:71%
but I think it's interesting

00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:09.583 size:72% position:36% line:71%
to look

00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:11.291 position:56% line:71%
at the actual documents themselves

00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:13.291 position:58% line:71%
that have appeared on social media,

00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:14.458 line:71%
because what it looks

00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:16.625 position:58% line:71%
like is a crinkled up piece of paper

00:02:16.625 --> 00:02:18.666 line:71%
that someone took a picture of.

00:02:18.666 --> 00:02:21.125 position:56% line:71%
And they have markings, as I said,

00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:23.291 line:71%
of top secret on some of them.

00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:25.750 position:61% line:71%
Some of them have markings of the office

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.125 size:84% position:42% line:71%
in the Pentagon

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:29.583 position:59% line:71%
that actually advises President Biden.

00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:32.125 position:58% line:71%
So these are as close as it gets to,

00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:34.125 position:58% line:71%
you know, the highest level of U.S.

00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:35.625 position:56% line:71%
secrets. And when you talk to U.S.

00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:37.833 line:71%
officials about these documents,

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:38.625 size:75% position:38% line:71%
obviously,

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.166 position:56% line:71%
they still say that they're doing

00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:41.541 line:71%
an overall assessment

00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:42.833 line:71%
to see if any of the documents

00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:44.000 size:84% position:42% line:71%
had been altered

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:44.916 line:71%
when they were put up

00:02:44.916 --> 00:02:46.416 line:71%
on these social media sites.

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:47.916 line:71%
But they do say that they do

00:02:47.916 --> 00:02:49.833 size:84% position:42% line:71%
look legitimate.

00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:50.875 line:71%
And do we think this was

00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.166 line:71%
a hacking of some sort?

00:02:52.166 --> 00:02:54.958 position:59% line:71%
Could it have been leaked out by U.S.

00:02:54.958 --> 00:02:56.541 line:71%
intelligence partners?

00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:58.291 line:71%
Somebody inside the

00:02:58.291 --> 00:02:59.666 line:71%
intelligence community or

00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:02.916 position:61% line:71%
inside the Defense Department, perhaps?

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.750 size:88% position:44% line:71%
Any sense of that?

00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:05.416 size:69% position:34% line:71%
Yeah.

00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:07.958 position:61% line:71%
I mean, all of those are possibilities.

00:03:07.958 --> 00:03:08.916 size:75% position:38% line:71%
As I said,

00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:10.708 position:61% line:71%
we just don't know the source right now.

00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:13.666 position:59% line:71%
But when it comes to US intelligence,

00:03:13.666 --> 00:03:14.625 size:88% position:44% line:71%
the United States

00:03:14.625 --> 00:03:15.875 line:71%
shares intelligence

00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:17.875 position:58% line:71%
with four other countries together.

00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:19.750 position:61% line:71%
They are known as the Five Eyes partner.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.833 line:71%
So it's the U.K., Canada,

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.500 position:56% line:71%
the US, Australia and New Zealand.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.833 position:56% line:71%
So those are some of the countries

00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:28.666 line:71%
that would have shared

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:29.666 size:78% position:39% line:71%
some of this

00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:31.958 position:56% line:71%
highly classified US information.

00:03:31.958 --> 00:03:34.250 position:59% line:71%
But when you look at these documents,

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.958 line:71%
some of them have markings

00:03:35.958 --> 00:03:36.916 size:81% position:41% line:71%
that indicate

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:38.791 position:56% line:71%
that there was information in them

00:03:38.791 --> 00:03:39.333 size:78% position:39% line:71%
that wasn't

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:41.416 position:56% line:71%
shared with any of those partners,

00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:43.458 line:71%
even those close U.S. partners.

00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:44.125 size:72% position:36% line:71%
So what

00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:45.000 size:81% position:41% line:71%
that indicates

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.625 size:72% position:36% line:71%
is that

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:47.916 position:59% line:71%
if they came all from the same source,

00:03:47.916 --> 00:03:49.375 line:71%
we don't know if they did,

00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:50.208 size:81% position:41% line:71%
but it appears

00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:51.625 position:59% line:71%
that they were all kind of dropped in

00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:53.291 line:71%
similar drops here,

00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:54.458 line:71%
that that would have come

00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:56.250 line:71%
from someone or something

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.208 size:88% position:44% line:71%
that gained access

00:03:57.208 --> 00:03:59.708 line:71%
to the US intelligence

00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:02.375 position:59% line:71%
system and not those of our partners.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:03.291 size:81% position:41% line:71%
But of course,

00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:05.208 line:71%
our partners are just as alarmed

00:04:05.208 --> 00:04:07.291 line:71%
by this as U.S. officials are.

00:04:07.291 --> 00:04:07.750 size:81% position:41% line:71%
They're doing

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:09.208 line:71%
their own damage assessments

00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:09.708 size:75% position:38% line:71%
right now

00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:10.708 line:71%
to try and figure out,

00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:11.041 size:75% position:38% line:71%
you know,

00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:12.666 position:58% line:71%
if any information they shared with

00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:13.583 size:72% position:36% line:71%
the U.S.

00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:15.166 position:56% line:71%
is now leaked into the public eye.

00:04:15.166 --> 00:04:16.541 size:84% position:42% line:71%
Jim, All right.

00:04:16.541 --> 00:04:18.000 line:71%
Kylie Atwood, thanks so much.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.833 line:71%
Really appreciate the reporting.

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:20.416 size:81% position:41% line:71%
Thanks again.

00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:21.833 position:58% line:71%
Let's get some perspective on this.

00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:22.833 size:84% position:42% line:71%
We're joined now

00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:25.416 position:63% line:71%
by retired Lieutenant General Ben Hodges.

00:04:25.416 --> 00:04:26.583 line:71%
A former commander of U.S.

00:04:26.583 --> 00:04:27.500 size:78% position:39% line:71%
Army Europe.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.791 line:71%
He's also a senior adviser

00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:31.041 line:71%
at Human Rights First.

00:04:31.041 --> 00:04:32.541 line:71%
General, great to see you.

00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:33.708 line:71%
What's your take on

00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:36.041 position:58% line:71%
these leaked intelligence documents

00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:37.500 line:71%
This does not happen very often.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.291 line:71%
And so when it does happen,

00:04:39.291 --> 00:04:40.708 line:71%
it has to be a big concern,

00:04:40.708 --> 00:04:41.833 line:71%
not only for the U.S.

00:04:41.833 --> 00:04:43.041 line:71%
intelligence community,

00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:44.208 size:78% position:39% line:71%
but as Kiley

00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:46.125 position:58% line:71%
was talking about a few moments ago,

00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:48.416 position:59% line:71%
major U.S. allies, major U.S. partners

00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:53.708 line:71%
Yeah, great reporting by Kiley.

00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:55.875 position:56% line:71%
Obviously, this is very damaging.

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:57.708 line:71%
You never want your enemy

00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:00.000 line:71%
to know what you know.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.500 size:88% position:44% line:71%
Or how you got it.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.375 line:71%
So this will reveal the depth

00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:06.625 position:61% line:71%
of penetration and a lot of information

00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:08.083 size:78% position:39% line:71%
that we had.

00:05:08.083 --> 00:05:09.666 line:71%
And, of course, one of the keys

00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:10.083 size:72% position:36% line:71%
to good

00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:12.250 position:58% line:71%
intelligence is being able to share

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.458 position:61% line:71%
with other allies, other organizations.

00:05:15.458 --> 00:05:19.000 position:63% line:71%
And so this will damage some of the trust

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.958 position:56% line:71%
that's necessary to have this good

00:05:22.291 --> 00:05:24.583 line:71%
intelligence sharing.

00:05:24.583 --> 00:05:26.166 line:71%
I expect the investigation

00:05:26.166 --> 00:05:28.333 position:56% line:71%
will eventually sort of figure out

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:29.500 line:71%
where did it come from

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.333 line:71%
or how did they get out.

00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:31.208 size:78% position:39% line:71%
But it does

00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:32.250 size:88% position:44% line:71%
it does once again

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.625 line:71%
remind us of the vulnerabilities

00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:34.208 size:72% position:36% line:71%
we have

00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:36.750 position:61% line:71%
and probably some holes in our systems.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.083 position:56% line:71%
I can't count the number of times

00:05:39.083 --> 00:05:39.708 size:78% position:39% line:71%
I had to go

00:05:39.708 --> 00:05:40.500 size:81% position:41% line:71%
through online

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.083 size:81% position:41% line:71%
training about

00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:43.750 position:58% line:71%
preventing just this kind of thing.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.416 line:71%
And so at the end of the day,

00:05:45.416 --> 00:05:46.125 size:88% position:44% line:71%
it's usually about

00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:47.083 line:71%
training and discipline

00:05:48.291 --> 00:05:48.833 size:69% position:34% line:71%
Right.

00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:49.083 size:75% position:38% line:71%
And these

00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:50.125 line:71%
documents are similar

00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:51.875 position:56% line:71%
to a batch of classified documents

00:05:51.875 --> 00:05:53.416 size:81% position:41% line:71%
about Ukraine

00:05:53.416 --> 00:05:55.041 position:56% line:71%
that have been circulating online

00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:56.333 line:71%
in recent weeks, which U.S.

00:05:56.333 --> 00:05:57.500 line:71%
officials on Friday morning

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.166 position:56% line:71%
confirmed to CNN to be authentic.

00:05:59.166 --> 00:06:00.791 line:71%
Some of the documents,

00:06:00.791 --> 00:06:01.291 size:81% position:41% line:71%
which include

00:06:01.291 --> 00:06:03.125 line:71%
estimates of Russian casualties

00:06:03.125 --> 00:06:04.750 position:59% line:71%
and a list of Western weapons systems

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.041 line:71%
available to Ukraine,

00:06:06.041 --> 00:06:06.958 line:71%
were apparently posted

00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:09.083 line:71%
on social media in March.

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:10.166 size:84% position:42% line:71%
Ukraine believes

00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:12.750 position:59% line:71%
Russia is behind this purported leak.

00:06:13.166 --> 00:06:14.041 line:71%
What do you think, General?

00:06:14.041 --> 00:06:14.250 size:72% position:36% line:71%
I mean,

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.291 line:71%
could this jeopardize

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:18.041 position:58% line:71%
Ukrainian forces on the battlefield

00:06:18.041 --> 00:06:18.916 line:71%
How serious is it for

00:06:18.916 --> 00:06:20.958 line:71%
what's happening in Ukraine?

00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:23.458 size:84% position:42% line:71%
Well, you know,

00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:25.625 line:71%
the Ukrainians, of course,

00:06:25.625 --> 00:06:27.250 line:71%
are super disciplined.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:28.416 line:71%
They've always been reluctant

00:06:28.416 --> 00:06:29.791 line:71%
to share information.

00:06:29.791 --> 00:06:30.666 size:88% position:44% line:71%
We've always known

00:06:30.666 --> 00:06:32.333 position:59% line:71%
more about Russian forces than we did

00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:33.833 size:88% position:44% line:71%
Ukrainian forces.

00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:35.375 line:71%
And so I think they will

00:06:36.166 --> 00:06:36.791 size:78% position:39% line:71%
they'll have

00:06:36.791 --> 00:06:37.833 size:88% position:44% line:71%
done an assessment

00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:40.583 position:58% line:71%
and figure out what they need to do.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:41.416 size:84% position:42% line:71%
But they're also

00:06:41.416 --> 00:06:43.041 line:71%
the Ukrainians are agile enough

